        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Chang Gung University. Published by Elsevier B.V. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "In this issue of the Biomedical Journal, we explore the inner workings of tumor-associated macrophages and seek to understand how these cells can boost or limit the efficacy of radiotherapy, depending on the context. We also highlight a study revealing that staffing patterns in the intensive care unit may affect the outcome of patients with severe sepsis. Finally, we learn how an advanced imaging technique can improve endodontic treatment planning."
